  steps: [
    { math: '1 · Duty of care', note: 'Did the defendant owe the claimant a legal obligation to be careful? The neighbour principle (Donoghue v Stevenson, 1932 — the snail in the ginger beer bottle): owe care to those closely affected by your acts.' },
    { math: '2 · Breach: falling below the standard', note: 'The reasonable-person test: what would a careful person have done? Professionals are held to professional standards — specialists to specialist care.' },
